### 1 GET /index.html
GET http://localhost:8080/index.html
Accept: text/html
###

### 2 GET /api/v1/items — доступ для USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json
###

### 3 GET /api/v1/items — доступ для ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###

### 4 GET /api/v1/items — доступ для SUPERADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
Accept: application/json
###

### 5 GET /api/v1/items/{id} — доступ USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json
###

### 6 GET /api/v1/items/hello/user — доступ USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/hello/user
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: text/plain
###

### 7 GET /api/v1/items/hello/admin — доступ ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin
