###

### 10 Спроба створити користувача через ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/create
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "name10",
  "description": "d10"
}
###

### 11 Спроба створити користувача через USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/create
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "name10",
  "description": "d10"
}
###

### 12 DELETE /api/v1/items/delete/{id} — видалення SUPERADMIN
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/delete/1
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
